  "text": "proprium.sancti-andreae-apostoli-collecta",
  "about": "The collecta of the formulary “Saint Andrew the Apostle” in the 1962 Roman Missal.",
  "segments": {
    "s01": { "translation": "We humbly pray Your majesty, O Lord, that, as blessed Andrew was a preacher and ruler in Your Church, so he may always intercede for us with You. Through our Lord Jesus Christ, Thy Son, who liveth and reigneth with Thee in the unity of the Holy Ghost, God, world without end. Amen." }
  },
